example:
改字段类型要新索引 + reindex + 别名切换：

```http
PUT /products_v2
{ "mappings": { "properties": { "price": { "type": "integer" } } } }
POST /_reindex
{ "source": { "index": "products" }, "dest": { "index": "products_v2" } }
POST /_aliases
{ "actions": [
  { "remove": { "index": "products", "alias": "products" } },
  { "add": { "index": "products_v2", "alias": "products" } }
] }
```
